"""THE LOCKED HISTORY ROWS (Codex SEQ 1476).

The V6-correction and signer calls used to be read straight out of
`finalization["ledger"]["scheduled"]`, so a corrupted record could move the
call ceiling. They are now counted from the signed A4 V6 lock's own pins and
each run's ordered `allowed`.

Every mutation here is applied to a COPY. The real paid evidence is never
written to.
"""
